; For Audi A3 (8P), no guaranties
Byte 00 Bit 0 Fog light installed
Byte 00 Bit 1 Xenon head lights with shutter installed
Byte 00 Bit 2 Footwell light installed
Byte 00 Bit 3 Daytime driving lights (Scandinavia) active
Byte 00 Bit 4 Daytime driving lights (North America) active
Byte 00 Bit 5 Assistance driving light with Leaving-Home
Byte 00 Bit 6 Rain-/Light sensor installed
Byte 00 Bit 7 Coming-Home installed
Byte 01 Bit 0 Rear seat recognition installed
Byte 01 Bit 1 Front Head light washer installed
Byte 01 Bit 2 Electronic fuelpump relay installed
Byte 01 Bit 3 Rear wiper installed
Byte 01 Bit 4 Heated side mirror installed
Byte 01 Bit 5 Rear hatch remote opening
Byte 01 Bit 6 Rear hatch remote opening allowed - active
Byte 01 Bit 7 Rear Wiper active driving backwards with continuesly wiper in front
Byte 02 Bit 0 Rear Wiper active driving backwards with intermit wiper in front
Byte 02 Bit 1 Automatic turn signal on Highway when changing lane (press turn signal arm light)
Byte 02 Bit 2 Cold lamp diagnostics (no light on) (mandatory)
Byte 02 Bit 3 Loadmanagement (mandatory)
Byte 02 Bit 4 Coming-Home Mode by		(0 = Adaption / 1 = Potentiometer)
Byte 02 Bit 5 Rear lid remote openening	(0 = impuls activated / 1 = contact activated)
Byte 02 Bit 6 Side turn signal lights installed 
Byte 02 Bit 7 Seat heating installed
Byte 03 Bit 0 Relay pin 15 inside installed
